# Every text file is checked out with LF endings on every platform.
# `text=auto` alone checks out the native line endings, and the plugin
# package is built from the working tree -- a CRLF file ships with CRLF and
# stops matching the committed source. That hits LICENSE and _assets/icon.svg,
# which ship in the package and have no extension rule below.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
